skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
hide footbox

legend bottom
  Informative response-signing proposal; successful requests only.
endlegend

actor "Public user" as User
participant "DPP service" as DPP #FFF2CC
participant "AAS service" as AAS #D9EAF7

User -> DPP : Read DPP by product ID\nAccept-Signature (optional)
DPP -> AAS : Read public DPP data without access token
AAS -> AAS : Example 1: apply GLOBAL(ANONYMOUS)\nRead Technical Data and Carbon Footprint
AAS --> DPP : Permitted Submodel data
DPP -> DPP : Sign response only when requested
DPP --> User : DPP data\nContent-Digest + Signature-Input + Signature (when requested)
@enduml
